                <span class="feature-index">01</span>
                <h3>Zero-Friction Work Capture</h3>
                <p class="feature-lead">Built to get out of the worker’s way — fast, precise, and highly practical.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li><strong>10-Second Navigation:</strong> A streamlined mobile-first interface gets operators to the right project step and inputting data in 10 seconds or less.</li>
                    <li><strong>Universal Work Templates:</strong> Track more than welding. Define custom work types — fit-up, cutting, assembly — save them as organization-wide templates, and capture any floor activity without slowing the team down.</li>
                    <li><strong>Pragmatic Parameter Tracking:</strong> Logs custom parameters and dates instantly, without bottlenecking the floor with digital signatures for routine entries.</li>
                    <li><strong>Offline-First Work Capture (Standard):</strong> Capture is built to run disconnected — welders record work with no connection at all, not just when it happens to drop. A durable on-device queue holds every entry and syncs automatically, in order, the moment the connection returns — nothing lost, even in a total Wi-Fi dead zone. Included on Standard; the offline document viewer stays on every plan.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="feature-out"><a href="welding-work-capture-software.html">See the workflow app in depth &rarr;</a></p>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card feature-block" id="live-views">
                <span class="feature-index">02</span>
                <h3>One Project, Two Live Views</h3>
                <p class="feature-lead">The tree and the flowchart are two windows onto the same project — switch whenever you want.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li><strong>Switch Views at Will:</strong> Every project is editable as a Tree or a Flowchart, toggled with one click. Edits in one view appear instantly in the other — no import, export, or conversion step.</li>
                    <li><strong>Tree View:</strong> A clear, left-indented project tree for detailed and one-off structures.</li>
                    <li><strong>Flowchart View:</strong> A visual editor for standardized, highly repeatable project structures.</li>
                    <li><strong>One-Paste BOM Import:</strong> Copy your BOM straight out of Tekla or most CAD packages and paste it into an Excel-like grid. Elenchon auto-detects columns and maps every field — and because you can adjust the mapping by hand at import, formats it doesn't recognise still go in cleanly. An afternoon of data entry becomes a single paste.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="feature-out"><a href="weld-project-structure-software.html">See project structure &amp; BOM import in depth &rarr;</a></p>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card feature-block" id="management">
                <span class="feature-index">03</span>
                <h3>Management & Access Control</h3>
                <p class="feature-lead">Top-down control that stays clean as your operation grows.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li><strong>Anti-Bloat Manager Interface:</strong> The management app automatically hides any feature or data a user lacks permission to see — every screen stays clean and free of administrative clutter.</li>
                    <li><strong>Live Project Editing:</strong> Modify in-progress projects by adding nodes or deleting empty ones. The system automatically locks and protects any node that already contains captured work.</li>
                    <li><strong>Global Custom Roles:</strong> Create fully custom roles and manage access top-down, eliminating project-by-project permission headaches.</li>
                    <li><strong>One-Click Document Generator:</strong> Pulls captured node data straight into your company’s paperwork templates for immediate printing — reusable across one project or the entire organization.</li>
                    <li><strong>Role-Sensitive Notifications:</strong> An in-app dashboard filters critical warnings — expirations, maintenance — strictly by role, keeping leaders informed without spamming phones.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="feature-out"><a href="welding-qms-access-control-software.html">See management &amp; access control in depth &rarr;</a></p>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card feature-block" id="qualifications">
                <span class="feature-index">04</span>
                <h3>Qualifications & Procedures</h3>
                <p class="feature-lead">Deep, automatic tracking of the credentials that keep you compliant.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li><strong>Qualification Engine:</strong> Deep tracking for welder and non-welder qualifications. Automatically logs 6-month continuity from actual floor entries and warns before expirations.</li>
                    <li><strong>End-to-End WPS/PQR Workflow:</strong> Define a preliminary WPS in the app, capture actual PQR parameters on the shop floor, import real values back, adjust ranges, and export a finalized WPS — with official files uploaded or linked at any stage.</li>
                    <li><strong>Live WPQR Capture:</strong> Capture Welding Procedure Qualification Record parameters on the floor and see them reflected in the management app instantly.</li>
                    <li><strong>Fast Heat Propagation:</strong> Heat numbers are captured, linked to their parent MTRs, and automatically propagated down the project tree — full traceability without database bloat.</li>
                    <li><strong>Versioned as Captured:</strong> Every document, parameter, and consumable is versioned and verified the moment it is captured. Corrections are versioned too and stay visible to managers — a clean history without an administrative bottleneck.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="feature-out"><a href="welding-qualification-software.html">See our dedicated welding qualification software (WPS, PQR &amp; WPQ) &rarr;</a></p>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card feature-block" id="assets">
                <span class="feature-index">05</span>
                <h3>Floor Asset & Consumable Control</h3>
                <p class="feature-lead">Proactive management of the tools and materials that keep the floor running.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li><strong>In-App Maintenance Hub:</strong> Five priority levels, from routine to emergency, with the critical tiers locked to authorised roles. Workers raise maintenance requests from the floor app — offline too, queued on-device and synced on reconnect — while maintenance personnel manage the whole workflow from the management app.</li>
                    <li><strong>Universal Machine Tracking:</strong> Certifications and maintenance schedules for any machine — not just welding gear — with attached certification documents and automated renewal alerts.</li>
                    <li><strong>Consumable Batch Tracking:</strong> Granular inventory logging for storage and reheat rules, with customizable low-stock alerts.</li>
                    <li><strong>On-Demand Offline Access:</strong> Workers save crucial WPS or construction plans with one click for instant access anywhere on the floor — even in total Wi-Fi dead zones.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="feature-out"><a href="welding-equipment-management-software.html">See our dedicated welding equipment, calibration &amp; consumable management &rarr;</a></p>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card feature-block" id="sovereignty">
                <span class="feature-index">06</span>
                <h3>Bulletproof Data Sovereignty</h3>
                <p class="feature-lead">Enterprise-grade security without the enterprise IT headaches.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li><strong>On-Premise Appliance:</strong> Runs on a dedicated, containerized local server — fully insulated from forced OS updates and external cloud outages.</li>
                    <li><strong>Absolute Data Ownership:</strong> Data stays on your physical hardware. Cancel anytime and retain view-only access to all historical data for audits.</li>
                    <li><strong>Optional Remote Access Module:</strong> Reach the management app or capture work from home, over mobile data, or in the field — as a small monthly add-on.</li>
                    <li><strong>Post-Quantum-Safe Encryption:</strong> All internal network routing and the remote access module are secured with Post-Quantum Safe Encryption (PQSE).</li>
                    <li><strong>Automated Local Backups:</strong> Customizable, frequent backups to isolated physical storage guarantee business continuity.</li>
